Now I'll edit the StudentController:
1. Add imports: `App\Services\QualifixService`, `App\Http\Requests\StoreQualifixTicketRequest`, `App\Models\File`, `App\Models\ClassGroup` maybe.
2. Add constructor with QualifixService.
